HistorIO border data (historio-borders)

This repository contains data derived from the following sources. Changes made by HistorIO are described below.

1. Cliopatria v0.2.1 (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23128623)
   Seshat Global History Databank. Licensed under CC BY 4.0
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
   Changes: polygons simplified, clipped to land, fitted to coastlines, corrected
   where the source is wrong (see the corrections table in scripts/), time model
   converted to year frames, names and Wikipedia links kept.

2. historical-basemaps, by A. Ourednik (https://github.com/aourednik/historical-basemaps)
   Licensed under GPL-3.0. Changes: snapshots simplified and re-encoded as
   TopoJSON, clipped to land not held by a Cliopatria state in the same year,
   names matched to identifiers. The derived files and the scripts that make
   them are provided here under GPL-3.0; see LICENSE.

3. Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/)
   Public domain. Used for modern borders, coastlines and as a geometry source
   for corrections.

4. NASA Blue Marble Next Generation (https://visibleearth.nasa.gov/collection/1484/blue-marble)
   Public domain. Not included here; listed because the app uses it.

The HistorIO application loads these files as separate data at run time.
It is not part of this repository.

